      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those additional phrases, such as \"it is important to note\" and \"in these challenging times,\" indeed share similarities with the original phrases you mentioned. They can be seen as linguistic markers that signal a transition or an emotional shift, often followed by a statement that aims to introduce or relay negative information. Functionally, these phrases serve as emotional anchors, creating a narrative framing that primes the audience to receive the accompanying information in a more accepting or complacent manner. They can also be used to stoke empathy, creating a sense of shared experience or vulnerability.",
      "source": "target",
